The {{Term/Store|Fierce Deity Armor||Series, TotK}},{{Exp Game|TotK}}<ref name="TotK Adventure Log"/> also known as the {{Term/Store|Fierce Deity Set||BotW}},{{Exp Game|BotW}}<ref name="CaC 193"/> is a recurring [[Armor Set]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Fierce Deity Set is an [[Armor Set]] consisting of the [[Fierce Deity Mask]], [[Fierce Deity Armor]], and [[Fierce Deity Boots]]. All three pieces can be obtained using the [[Amiibo (Ability)|amiibo]] [[Rune]] while scanning the {{MM}} [[Link]] [[amiibo]]. Each time the figure is scanned, a [[Treasure Chest]] will appear that has a small chance to contain one of the pieces. As the amiibo can only be scanned once per real-world day, a player must collect the Set over three or more real-world days. 

The Set can be enhanced by a [[Great Fairy]] but cannot be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. When it has been enhanced by two levels, it provides the [[Charge Atk. Stamina Up]] [[Set Bonus]] when worn with the full Set, while each piece individually provides a single [[Attack Up]] effect. It resembles the armor worn by [[Fierce Deity Link]] from {{MM|-}}. 

